o reach the brain, where it supports better sleep quality, mental clarity, and a calmer nervous system.", "supportingFindings": ["Sleep disruption reported", "Low energy reported", "Brain fog reported", "Irritability reported"]}, {"dose": "1 tablet daily", "name": "HerWellness™ Estrovera®", "caution": "Clinically studied ERr 731 rhubarb extract for vasomotor symptom relief. Non-hormonal option. Effects typically noticed within 4 weeks.", "category": "hormone-support", "priority": "medium", "rationale": "Estrovera provides clinically studied ERr 731 Siberian rhubarb extract specifically for vasomotor symptom relief (hot flashes, night sweats). Best suited for women with active vasomotor symptoms who need non-hormonal support.", "indication": "Postmenopausal status; Sleep disruption (vasomotor-related); Irritability reported", "phenotypes": ["Menopausal Transition"], "confidenceLevel": "moderate", "patientExplanation": "This plant-based supplement is clinically proven to help with hot flashes, night sweats, and related sleep and mood changes. It works without hormones and most women notice improvement within 4 weeks.", "supportingFindings": ["Postmenopausal status", "Sleep disruption (vasomotor-related)", "Irritability reported"]}, {"dose": "1 soft chew during times of stress", "name": "HerWellness™ Rapid Stress Relief", "caution": "Fast-acting L-Theanine and Lactium formula. Non-drowsy. Promotes calm within 1 hour. Contains milk.", "category": "hormone-support", "priority": "medium", "rationale": "HerWellness Rapid Stress Relief provides fast-acting stress support with L-Theanine (200mg) and Lactium. Promotes calm within 1 hour without drowsiness.", "indication": "Sleep disruption (stress-related); Irritability reported", "phenotypes": ["Stress / Cortisol Dysregulation"], "confidenceLevel": "moderate", "patientExplanation": "This fast-acting supplement helps your body respond to stress more calmly. It promotes relaxation within about an hour and can be taken as neede